*** Settings ***
Documentation       Technical helper keywords for image and PDF comparisons. Only here are keywords of the
...                 DocTestLibrary used.
Resource            ${EXECDIR}/resources/abilities/doctest_ability.resource
Keyword Tags        interaction


*** Keywords ***
Reference File
    [Documentation]    Returns the full path of a reference file.
    [Arguments]    ${file_name}
    RETURN    ${REFERENCE_DIR}/${file_name}

Compare Two Images
    [Documentation]    Compares two images. Visible differences make the step fail
    ...    and the log shows them.
    [Arguments]    ${reference}    ${candidate}
    Compare Images    ${reference}    ${candidate}

Compare Two Pdfs
    [Documentation]    Compares two PDF files (appearance and text).
    [Arguments]    ${reference}    ${candidate}
    Compare Pdf Documents    ${reference}    ${candidate}

Check Texts In Pdf
    [Documentation]    Checks that all texts occur in the PDF.
    [Arguments]    ${pdf}    @{texts}
    PDF Should Contain Strings    ${texts}    ${pdf}
